# Example: construction_multi_step.wcn

## Schema

```
Person = String/name String/address
School = [Person]/students
Team = [Person]/players
Town = School Team
```

## Construction

```
people = 
[:Array/Person 
   [:Person "John Smith" "1 The Avenue"]
   [:Person "Jane Jones" "43 Long Street"]].

[:Town [:School people] [:Team people]]
```
 